window.products.push({"id":668037,"name":"Le Benton Reversible LoveSeat Cover, Non-Slip 3-Strap for Maximum Results, Adjustable & Removable, Machine Washable, Up to 45\" Seat Width - Brown/Taup","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lKDccRuXL._AC_SL1237_.jpg","description":"Most Secured sofa cover on the market The Le Benton triple strap sofa slipcover, with 1 Horizontal elastic strap and 2 vertical straps, is the MOST secured way to keep your sofa cover in place, (see picture) ALSO recommended for leather, Don’t get carried away by so called patents and techniques, this is the most secured anti-slip that will stay in place.  Is your couch top flat aligned with arms and no place for horizontal strap? Don’t’ worry use just our 2 vertical straps, and keep your cover secured our 2 vertical straps is your best choice.  Our elastic strap is thick and durable, adjustable and removable for your total convenience. Elegant and stylish Sofas, arm chairs and loveseats are expensive purchases which is why it is important to protect them and reduce the opportunity for damage with our easy to fit furniture slipcovers. The reversible design is quilted for comfort and durability so as not to disturb the comfort of you, your family, pets and dogs. Range of sizes available We have a choice of slipcovers for armchairs, oversized sofas, regular couches and loveseats too. Choose the most suitable for your needs and be sure to measure your item first to make sure it will be a good fit: Seat Width: Extra Wide Sofa up to 88\" Wide Sofa up to 78\" Sofa up to 68\" Wide Love Seat up to 55\" Love Seat up to 46\" Chair up to 23\" Elegant and stylish Sofas, arm chairs and loveseats are expensive purchases which is why it is important to protect them and reduce the opportunity for damage with our easy to fit furniture slipcovers. The reversible design is quilted for comfort and durability so as not to disturb the comfort of you, your family, pets and dogs. BUY NOW and add some stylish protection to your sofas and chairs with our range of furniture slipcovers","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lKDccRuXL._AC_SL1237_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Le Benton","source_asin":"B07KPQBF3Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-668037","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KPQBF3Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KPQBF3Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":668038,"name":"marshmallow dream Year-Round Feather Down Comforter, Fluffy Twin Size Duvet Insert or Stand-Alone for All-Season Soft Cotton Fabric Down Comforter wit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UYC6b452L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM FEATHER DOWN FILLER ---These pink down comforters are filled with a selection of 70% feathers and 30% down,Fluffy and odorless. We use responsibly harvested down and guarantee non-live plucked feathers, and the fillings are all RDS and OEKO-TEX certified professional. EXCELLENT & WASHABLE COTTON COVER---This duvet cover is made from a blend of 18% cotton and 82% polyester. The fabric is light, fine and smooth, soft and breathable, and can effectively prevent the down from spilling out, providing you with a noise-free and super comfortable night sleep. OUTSTANDING DESIGN --- The feather down comforter adopts box stitching technology to make the down evenly distributed, avoiding uneven heights caused by little down at the stitching, adding warmth, fluffiness and comfort to the comforter. ALL-SEASON COMFORTER: Available in twin(68x90 inches), queen(90x90 inches), and King size (106x90 inches)to accommodate individual sleeping preferences. Medium weight is ideal for year round use in climate controlled temperatures in most climates making this warmth level our most popular. EASY CARE & CONVENIENT - Machine washable (in cold water), which saves you a lot of time and energy. Tumble dry on low heat. Clap the comforter and it will restore its fluff and softness as ever after a few hours and a few days of use. The goose down comforter will produce an odor after washing, but the smell will dissipate when it is totally dried. Please don't worry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UYC6b452L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"marshmallow dream","source_asin":"B097B5KXN8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-668038","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097B5KXN8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097B5KXN8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
