window.products.push({"id":668121,"name":"Cook with Color Toaster, Stainless Steel 2 Slice Rounded, Wide Slot Toaster with 6 Browning and Toasting Levels, with Bagel, Defrost and Cancel Option","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9197f9Fn8AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ADD COLOR TO YOUR HOME: Accessorize your kitchen and countertop with this retro toaster featuring a sleek, pink, speckled design. Add simple style while toasting bread and bagels, making your morning that much brighter. HAVE YOUR TOAST ANY WAY YOU LIKE IT: Our 825-watt stainless steel toaster is designed to keep every family member happy. 6 browning levels, 3 easy push functions: defrost (use for frozen bread), bagel (one sided toasting function) and cancel (stop toasting whenever you want). MORE AWESOME FEATURES: Extra wide 1.5\" slots can easily fit thick slices of bread, bagels, waffles, or whatever you feel like toasting. Bread will automatically pop up when finished but lever can be lifted higher making it safer and easier to reach all sized slices. Our stainless steel quality toaster is designed to last and help you create beautiful memories while spending time with family and friends over casual breakfasts and lunches. EASY TO CLEAN AND STORE: No one likes greeting a messy toaster in the morning or the smell of burned crumbs. Our toaster has a removable crumb tray for easy cleaning, remove the tray and dump the crumbs to clean. When not in use, place the toaster’s electrical cord in the cord holder for easy storage. CUSTOMER SATISFACTION GUARANTEE - At Cook with Color, our #1 goal is customer satisfaction, please feel free to reach out to us so we can ensure that your Cook with Color order experience is positive and hassle free.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9197f9Fn8AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COOK WITH COLOR","source_asin":"B09BP5KBFL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-668121","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BP5KBFL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BP5KBFL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":668122,"name":"ALOKA 4 Pieces Beach Towel Clips Plastic Large Beach Towels Clips for Sun Lounger Beach Pool Lounge Chair Holder Cruise Clothes Lines Decorative Trave","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61boRkQw78L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHAT'S INCLUDE - There are 4 pieces beach towel clips in one package. They are cute and practical for your life STURDY & LONG LASTING - These beach towel clips are made of high-quality plastic to protect from breakage. They are long lasting, and can effectively hold the towel in place. Use them to fix the blanket to the chair, hang your clothes to dry or attach to your bag for closing MULTIFUNCTIONAL - The beach chair towel holders can be used to close food, hang clothes, and hold wet swimwear, as well as hold the sheets VIBRANT SUMMER DESIGN - The cute styles make your beach travel more fun, can be used as beach decorations LIGHTWEIGHT & PORTABLE - These beach pool towel holders can be placed in your bag on your beach trips without taking up too much space, which can fit in any size beach chair and help with your towels or laundry on a cruise ship","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61boRkQw78L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ALOKA","source_asin":"B09WCT5W9F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-668122","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WCT5W9F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WCT5W9F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":668123,"name":"Epicurean Non-Slip Series Cutting Board, 14.5-Inch by 11.25-Inch, Natural/Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qfujmiawL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This durable, dishwasher safe board by Epicurean is Made in USA, specifically on the North Shore of Lake Superior in Duluth, MN.  It is an excellent choice for both the casual cook and the seasoned gourmet who values the environment and wants a dependable cutting board that is durable and cleans up easily. Every Non-Slip Cutting Board is made with naturally renewable or recycled materials in an environmentally responsible way, made from a wood fiber composite with silicone corners that grip the surface of your countertop.  Wood Fiber Composite is sheets of resin-saturated fiber are compressed and baked to a solid sheet.  The final product is exceptionally strong, yet maintains the warm, natural look and feel of wood. It is lightweight, nonporous, knife friendly and dishwasher safe.  It won’t crack, split, or stain – making it the perfect material for cutting and serving.  It also is classified as green.  The wood fiber raw material comes from Forest Stewardship Council (FSC) certified sources and/or recycled paper.  This durable material itself has been around for more than 65 years and is widely used for commercial, industrial and marine purposes, as well as skate park surfaces.  It certainly can take anything dished out in the heart of the kitchen. The durable boards have a ¼” profile so they are lightweight and easy to store.  The built in hole makes it easy to grab and use.  Epicurean is a way of life - a reflection of our personal values and those of our customers. Our products are well-designed, practical, casual tools that feel at home in any kitchen where friends and family gather to share company and enjoy good food. This natural colored non-slip board with slate silicone corners measures 11.5 x 9 inches, can be used on both sides and is dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qfujmiawL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Epicurean","source_asin":"B008D88R6U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-668123","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008D88R6U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008D88R6U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
