window.products.push({"id":668176,"name":"Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liner 200 Pcs Square Paper Liners Disposable Large for 5 to 8 Qt Basket,Unbleached Non-stick Oil-proof Parchment Paper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KcaEP6m8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍟BREEZE THE CLEANING: Using parchment liners for the air fryers will be a total game-changer if you find it’s a hassle to clean all the oil, grill tray, and cumbersome basket after each cooking. The disposable rectangular liner holds oil from the food, glaze and sauce that would normally drip off and burn onto the pot, just simply rest the paper on the tray and all is no need to Clean Basket. 🍗200 PCS 6.3” PRE-CUT SIZE: Each square liner figures a bowl shape with 6.3” in bottom width and 2” in edge height. PLEASE MEASURE YOUR AIR FRYER BASKET BOTTOM BEFORE PURCHASE! 200 pieces in one pack are enough for a long time of daily use. A series of size parchment liners designed for Air Fryer Cuisinart Chefman Gourmia Cosori air fryer Instant and Ninja air fryer cooker et.. 🥦DON’T USE THE PAPER DURING PRE-HEAT: Please weigh down the liner with food, If it's not sufficiently weighted down - the liner is liable to fly up into the heating element and burn. 🥓UNBLEACHED NATURAL PARCHMENT: Kreaid nonstick paper liners are made of food-grade natural wood pulp. Unbleached paper is totally fluorescent-free. 45gsm thickness is thicker than ordinary parchment to be durable and sturdy, and won’t tear when lifting even after cooking. It stands for high temperatures up to 430℉. It can also be used in frying pans, microwave ovens, ovens, and instant-pot. 🍕NON-STICK, WATER-OIL PROOF, CONVENIENT: The liner has a food-grade silicone coating that makes it waterproof and oil-resistant, the food will not stick to the liner surface and be damaged even though with rich sauce on. The paper doesn't insulate hot air flow like the silicone does. Take one piece and put it in the basket. After use, take it out and discard it. No cutting or measuring is required, easy and convenient.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KcaEP6m8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KreAid","source_asin":"B0BKKZ83S5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-668176","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKKZ83S5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKKZ83S5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
