window.products.push({"id":668475,"name":"Brooklyn Brew Shop/Stillwater Gose Gone Wild Beer Making Kit: All-Grain Set With Reusable Glass Fermenter, Brew Equipment, Ingredients (Malted Barley,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.51,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jAIrvKJVL._AC_.jpg","description":"If you can make oatmeal, you can make beer. Brooklyn Brew Shop's kitchen-friendly Beer Making Kits makes brewing easy by using only fresh, whole ingredients and traditional methods used in homes and breweries for centuries. By brewing with the same ingredients (malted barley, hops, and yeast) that the best craft breweries in the world use, making high quality and complex beers becomes possible on the stovetop in your very own kitchen, big or small. Take a sip on the wild side with our super-unique, easy-to-master sour ale kit. Made in collaboration with Stillwater Artisanal Ales, an art collective headed by Baltimore native/Brooklyn based Brian Stumke, Wild is both easy-drinking and deeply complex. We scaled down the Stillwater recipe so you can recreate this traditional German wheat beer on your very own stovetop. A forest of West Coast American hops dials up the brightness while the addition of lactobacillus (the same stuff that makes yogurt, cheese, pickles and other fermented foods) adds that funkalicious bite. This untamed beer will be unlike any you've ever brewed before.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jAIrvKJVL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brooklyn Brew Shop","source_asin":"B074XJGW6R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-668475","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074XJGW6R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074XJGW6R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
