window.products.push({"id":668560,"name":"Madhu International White Gold Ombre Mandala Tapestry Hippie Cotton Tapestries Psychedelic Indian Traditional Wall Decor Tapestry Bohemian Wall Hangin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815s+chQfGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"<p>★ PREMIUM QUALITY - Crafted with the top grade cotton fabric, our psychedelic tapestry is superior to other tapestries in the market. The 100% pure cotton material makes this wall tapestry soft, comfy, stretchy, skin-friendly, and highly durable. This hippie tapestry is the conventional piece of mandala art which is more attractive than any other tapestries in the market. This bohemian tapestry is going to be your favourite home decor stuff for all holiday celebrations! </p> <p>★ RIGHT SIZE FOR YOUR NEEDS - This cotton bohemian tapestry made & printed in India comes in different sizes be it king, queen, twin, medium and poster for unique usage scenarios. Pick our exquisite wall hanging tapestry to add a rich, pleasing, and warm ethnic feel to all living spaces like the living room, bedroom, drawing, or dining room. And this tapestry with cute patterns is a wonderful way to add color to your wall, bed, and ceiling areas. </p> <p>★ EASY MAINTENANCE - Our mandala boho tapestry is recommended to wash with hands in cold water so that it will not drop its colors. Avoid using strong washing liquids, bleaching agents, ironing at high temperatures, and drying in the sun for a long time to make your purchase even more rewarding. Also, you can hang this large mandala tapestry easily on the wall with push pins or decorative tacks that deliver permanent harmonious decoration!. </p> <p>★ A COMPLETE MAKEOVER - Use this nature tapestry to make a great wall hanging, wall art, wall decor, poster use, bohemian bedding, hippie bedspread, beach or picnic blanket, table cloth, yoga mat, porch hangings, dorm decorations, room divider, ceiling decor, window curtains or any home decor purposes. This bohemian mandala tapestry handcrafted by local art masters focusing on each detail.This tapestry wall hanging is also used to make sections inside your house. </p> <p>★ Why Madhu International - Madhu International tapestry can become a whole new innovative styling option that you can add to your home decor. Our main goal here is to provide every home with the finest quality of tapestries at the most affordable prices. We envision customer satisfaction as our priority. So rest assured, whatever we sell is made to add a dramatic effect to your living space - the design says it all. Once you join our family, there is no letting you down in any aspect. </p>","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815s+chQfGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Madhu International","source_asin":"B07JMTQTG5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-668560","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JMTQTG5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JMTQTG5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
