window.products.push({"id":668579,"name":"Wicca Wicks - Box of 10 White Candles | 4 inches Tall & 3/4 inch Diameter | Witchcraft Supplies for Your Personal Wiccan Altar, Spells, Charms & Ritua","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Xp590gxSS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These unscented WHITE candles stand 4 inches tall and have a diameter of 3/4 of an inch. They are crafted using a blend of all-natural sustainable palm wax and the highest quality paraffin wax, allowing them to burn clean and even. The wick is braided cotton and specifically sized to these candles to ensure an even and clean burn while maintaining the perfect size flame. We never use metal core wicks which can be toxic to your environment. The WHITE color is brilliant and consistent inside and out. The surface of the candles are smooth and without defects. They are perfect for anyone with a desire to celebrate their faith with prayer and meditation. They’re also great for your everyday decoration, fun dinner party or a cozy night in with a glass of wine and a good book. Charitable Contributions - A percent of each sale is donated to the National Forest Foundation. $1 plants one tree!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Xp590gxSS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WICCA WICKS","source_asin":"B08PC9F6D9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-668579","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PC9F6D9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PC9F6D9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":668580,"name":"3 Inch Unscented Bulk Round Pillar Candles Qty 12 (3 X 6, White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":72.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31RJNdTk0YL._AC_.jpg","description":"Set of 12 unscented 3 inch x 6 inch These unscented White color 3\" X 6\" pillar candles are compression molded and then over dipped. The result is a smooth, drip less, burning pillar. These candles make for beautiful wedding decorations. Perfect for home as well. With its dripless and smokeless wax feature, these pillar candles burn very cleanly. These pillar candles are the lead-free and made with cotton wicks which make this a safe candle for any home. These candles measure 3\" x 6\" inches. Comes in a set of 12. Made in the USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31RJNdTk0YL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"D'light Online","source_asin":"B074WCBCDM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-668580","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074WCBCDM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074WCBCDM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":668581,"name":"North Carolina NC Home State Solid Navy Blue Officially Licensed Heart Love Wood Christmas Tree Holiday Ornament","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BlQrvEzlL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Ho ho ho! Make your Christmas tree something special this year - and for years to come - with this unique heart shaped wooden ornament from Graphics and More. Whether you're looking to commemorate a special occasion, give a gift with a personal touch, or just expand your collection of holiday pieces, this is the product for you! The product is cut from a beautiful natural-finish wood, then printed on one side with the festive design shown. Unlike glass bulb ornaments, this wooden decoration is not fragile, so it's perfect for families with kids or pets - or anyone who loves a classic, hand-made feel to their Christmas tree decorations. Cut from maple veneer wood. Design is single-sided; the back is left with the natural finish of the wood. Hand-tied cord for hanging the item is included. Ornament dimensions are 3.3\" (8.3 cm) x 2.7\" (6.9 cm). Since 2011, North Carolina-based \"Home State Apparel\" has been bringing their customers high-quality products featuring their unique \"HOME.\" designs. Licensed for use by Graphics and More. A Graphics and More product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BlQrvEzlL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GRAPHICS & MORE","source_asin":"B07K1M778X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-668581","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07K1M778X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07K1M778X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
