window.products.push({"id":668588,"name":"USS Franklin D. Roosevelt CVA-42 8x10 Silver Halide Photo Print","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51soOiKF1tL._AC_.jpg","description":"This museum grade traditional silver halide photograph is MADE IN THE USA directly from The McMahan Photo Archive's copyrighted full resolution restored originals.PHOTO DESCRIPTIONU.S. Navy photograph of Midway-class aircraft carrier USS Franklin D. Roosevelt (CVA-42) at sea.PHOTOGRAPHER / CREDIT: Copyright, The McMahan Photo Archive/RMP Archive/U.S. Navy, Robert M. Cieri PHOTO IMAGE DATE: circa 1971IMAGE ID: ZZ0134ABOUT OUR PHOTOGRAPHSThe McMahan Photo Archive mixes the best of today's print and restoration technologies with old fashioned hard work and artistry. People make the artistic decisions, not computers. We have printed over a million real light exposed and chemical processed silver halide prints since our start in 2001. What you are buying here is a REAL PHOTOGRAPH! At The McMahan Photo Art Gallery & Archive, you are always buying the best!Every order is backed by our 365 Day 100% RAVING FAN GUARANTEE! If your print isn't perfect, we will make it right or accept a return for a full refund. We really want you to be one of our raving fans!Robert McMahanFounder, Photographer, Historic Photo Print Expert","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51soOiKF1tL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The McMahan Photo Archive","source_asin":"B0742J8FK3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-668588","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0742J8FK3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0742J8FK3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
