window.products.push({"id":668619,"name":"Howard Miller Monticello Table Clock 645-754 – Brass Finished Home Decor, Glass Center Panel, Black Accents, Felt Bottom, Classic Square Timepiece, Qu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SI8ywCqEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TABLE CLOCK: The Monticello Table Clock is brass-finished featuring a glass center panel and dial with a circular brushed silver numeral ring to compliment your home decor. The clock’s quartz movement makes a soft ticking noise without the use of chimes for a quieter environment. DURABLE: This indoor modern clock is created to last. It has a sturdy metal frame to relieve stress in a busy household. Place it in your kitchen, office, bathroom, bedroom, living room, and more. HIGH QUALITY: The classic design shows traditional roman numerals, with IIII instead of IV, to become a home essential. Easily tell time with a black open-cut diamond style hour and minute hands, black second hand, glass crystal, and polished brass-tone bezel to stand out over the dial. DIMENSIONS: The height of this clock is 7.25 inches (18 cm), with a width of 6 inches (15 cm) and a depth of 1.75 inches (4 cm). It is powered by quartz movement, and includes one AA sized battery. The felt bottom will protect your desk or tabletop. HOWARD MILLER: Founded in 1926 and still family-owned in its third generation, Howard Miller is the world’s leading clock company and a respected brand name in fine specialty furnishings such as curio cabinets, wine and bar furnishings, custom storage cabinets, and SmartMoves adjustable height desks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SI8ywCqEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Howard Miller","source_asin":"B00L9YZAD8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-668619","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00L9YZAD8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00L9YZAD8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":668620,"name":"HOMBYS Goose Feather Down Bed Pillows for Sleeping (Standard Size 1 Pillow)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6116+SuhbRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Breathable Down Proof Cotton Cover, Bed Pillow is Soft Enough to Ensure you Sleep Restfully Whole Night.Unique design for Quiet Sleep.Feathers Never Crawl Out. Down Feather Pillows Standard Size :20x26 in, 38oz Natural Filling Won't Go Flat with Enough Support , Hotel Style. Suitable for Side, Stomach and Back Sleepers. Easy To Care ：Machine washed in the gentle cycle in cold water . Air dry or tumble dry on low temperature when need. Do not bleach or iron Packing Method : Down Feather Bed Pillows are vacuum packed and rolled in a PE bag .Please remove the vacuum bag and pat gently and air them for hours to recover their full . Hombys high quality bed pillows .Certified OEKO-TEX STANDARD 100 and BSCI. Buy with Confidence.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6116+SuhbRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMBYS","source_asin":"B081GZGG4V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-668620","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081GZGG4V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081GZGG4V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":668621,"name":"AGILLY Ice Packs for Lunch Bags, Reusable Ice Packs for Coolers & Lunch Box, Rapid Freeze & Long Lasting Ice Packs, Lightweight & Compact, Freezer Pac","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ALpAUin8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【RAPID FREEZE & LONG-LASTING】60-minute rapid-freezing, just store in the freezer for 60 minutes before using the small ice packs for a long-lasting adventure. Pack of 4, use single or multiple pieces together to improve freezing efficiency, bringing an extra-long freshness for food. Even without a refrigerator, AGILLY ice packs for lunch bags can give you a refrigerator-like experience. 【REUSABLE & DURABLE】AGILLY's long lasting ice packs will never wear out, reusable and easy to clean. Don't worry about leaks everywhere, just simply hand wash, dry and return to the freezer after use. The reusable ice pack is a great replacement of traditional ice cubes. More convenient to use, while giving you a powerful freezing effect. 【SQUARE & COMPACT DESIGN】Each of these lunch box ice packs measures 1.6 inch *1.6 inch *6.5 inch. Designed to be a square & compact design, the cooler ice packs can be stood up, it is very convenient to put in your lunch box/cooler without taking up too much space. It can also help more even chill through out the food/drinks. Great for all types of bags! 【HEALTHY & SAFE】These reusable ice packs are made from 100% BPA-free & non-toxic materials, and contain cooling gels that can be cycled indefinitely after the first activation to meet your long-term daily needs. Safe and leak-proof, you can use it in your lunch bag with confidence. Ensure you a healthy lifestyle! 【WIDESPREAD USE】The perfect freezer packs, suitable for many scenes of daily life. You can keep food fresh by adding cooler ice packs to your family's lunch box or bento box. It is also suitable for some outdoor activities, such as picnics, hiking, fishing, camping, etc. With AGILLY reusable ice packs, you can enjoy fresh food and cool drinks outdoors. A must for everyday life! CARE TIPS: Hand wash only. Do not microwave!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ALpAUin8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AGILLY","source_asin":"B09MT6CTWT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-668621","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MT6CTWT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MT6CTWT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
