window.products.push({"id":668715,"name":"VEVOR Clothing Garment Rack, 180 LBS Capacity, Heavy-duty Clothes Rack w/ Bottom Shelf & Extra 3 Side Shelves, 4 Swivel Casters, Rolling Clothes Organ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":108.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SnpNJvZFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep Your Home Tidy: Overall dimension: 47\"x14\"x63\"/120x36x160cm. Our garment rack is a simple solution to keep your home more organized. It is a must-have product for creating a tidy home and comfortable living environment. Quit running around to find that perfect sweater. Get ready to save time and look your best during any season. Extension of Your Wardrobe: The rolling clothes rack has a single bar and 4 shelves equipped to create plenty of space. The long wooden shelf on the bottom and 3 side shelves organize your garment, shoes, handbags, and boxes in order. Extend your storage place to your preferences. Be the fashion icon you have always wanted to be. Sturdy Metal Construction: This gold clothing rack is combined with sturdy Q235 iron and thick wood shelves, making it super stable and sturdy, with no chance to wobble and collapse. The powder spraying surface ensures it is rust-free. The 180 lbs weight capacity is enough to hold your seasonal clothes. Roll Out in Style: The standing clothes rack is equipped with 4 smooth wheels, 2 of them feature brakes (foot-operated) to make it more convenient to roll from the closet to the bedroom or living room. It can stay in place while you try on outfits. Say goodbye carrying heavy garments from one place to another. Set Up in Minutes: The simple instructions, assembly tools, and preset nuts in the wood boards make installation easy. It will take you less than 15 minutes to put it together. While not in use, take it down for easy storage. It is also easy to clean, using a wet cloth to wipe the surface and then put it in the dry place.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SnpNJvZFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VEVOR","source_asin":"B0BPGGXGHK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-668715","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPGGXGHK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPGGXGHK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
